RL-100 Diffusion RL Migration

This directory contains a rewritten and adapted implementation of method-level
ideas described by the RL-100 project:

  Lei-Kun/RL-100
  https://github.com/Lei-Kun/RL-100
  algorithm reference commit: 7c5df9a5d3111e5fa8d2fe814c4fdcb3acfa3f26
  audited source checkout: 3d52f73be4a1f7c27ed3bb32280adb36428f57e5

The upstream project is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
No RL-100 point-cloud, PointNet, runner, or vendored package files are copied
into this directory. The target modules are rewritten for LeRobot's state and
image observation dictionaries, Diffusion Policy processors, the 14D Moya
action contract, and Python 3.12/uv.

This migration also uses and retains attribution for the surrounding LeRobot
and diffusers projects under their respective licenses.
